The Bitcoin Review of Books (BRB) co-organizes, 
in collaboration with Bitcoin scholars, universities and other researchers, centers and supporters,  
the Bitcoin Student Research Prize:

https://github.com/Bitstorian69/Bitcoin-Student-Research-Prize--BRB-and-UW-BRI

Prizes are awarded based on a critical peer review process.

Prizes winners receive:
    • BTC (onchain or Lightning)
    • offer to publish research, firstly in GitHub 

Proof-of-worker winners ("runners up"):
    • receive hardware prize such as a BitAxe or coldcard

For more information and for the upcoming calls, see: 
https://github.com/Bitstorian69/Bitcoin-Student-Research-Prize--BRB-and-UW-BRI/releases

